Subject: [PATCH] Preserve active association ownership and unrelated radio states

Late capability reports are metadata, not association notifications. Merge
only into the exact active STA/BSSID/RUID while preserving metrics and age.
AL-wide topology, AP capability and channel preference reports must advance
only radios in their expected onboarding state under the command lock;
periodic reports must not reset in-flight candidate or steering commands.
Expose the agent orchestrator through the manager interface, as the
controller already does, so agent-side state transitions use a valid lock.

Upstream-Status: Pending

